---- take / put / putmask / place / take_along_axis / put_along_axis / choose / compress
ok   take mode='wrap' wraps every index modulo n (incl. negatives)
ok   take mode='clip' clips to [0, n-1] ('clipping to the range'; 'this disables indexing with negative numbers')
