ok   ravel_multi_index scalar docstring: (3,1,4,1) in (6,7,8,9) -> 1621
ok   ravel_multi_index wrap/clip x C/F against the closed-form strides (incl. negative / oversized)
ok   ravel_multi_index mode='raise' out of range raises ValueError
ok   unravel_index docstring: [22,41,37] in (7,6) -> ([3,6,6],[4,5,1]); F -> ([3,6,6],[4,5,1]) for [31,41,13]; 1621 -> (3,1,4,1)
